  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: gettext loads message catalogs from arbitrary paths via LANGUAGE directory traversal\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-84243.patch: gettext loads message catalogs from arbitrary paths via LANGUAGE directory traversal\n     - CVE-2026-84243\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: ld.so opens unnormalized $ORIGIN rpath in AT_SECURE programs\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-95818-CVE-2026-86805.patch: open the normalized $ORIGIN path\n     - CVE-2026-95818\n     - CVE-2026-86805\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: nscd stack overflow via alloca in aicache and hstcache\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-89092.patch: use malloc instead of alloca\n     - CVE-2026-89092\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: resolver assertion failure on search list truncation\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-8674.patch: fix truncation check in resolv_conf_matches\n     - CVE-2026-8674",
